    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#963;</mi></math> be the uniform surface charge density of two infinite thin plane sheets shown in figure. Then the electric fields in three different region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>I</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></msub></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></msub></math></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fc57115a-8030-4d98-b9cc-de45d23b0700-3e106b72-59f7-489f-b02c-46412875ada7-9896261.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 359px;\" /></p>",
