    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fc57115a-8030-4d98-b9cc-de45d23b0700-3e106b72-59f7-489f-b02c-46412875ada7-9896261.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 359px;\" /></p><p>Electric field due to charged sheet for charge density&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi>&#963;</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>&#963;</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Assuming RHS to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>I</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#963;</mi><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp; (leftwards)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#963;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#963;</mi><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mfenced><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; (rightwards)</p>",
